00:05:07.046 --> 00:05:10.168
Bill, Bill, Bill, Bill, Bill.

00:05:10.168 --> 00:05:12.305
Am I happy with you.

00:05:12.305 --> 00:05:17.093
Because you've asked the
question that means so much to me

00:05:17.093 --> 00:05:18.714
and is something that

00:05:18.714 --> 00:05:23.714
